  "details": "Reproduce steps:\n1. Create any type of array variable\n2. Open it and press \"Edit\" button\n3. Press \"Save\" button.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.10.11.29_Closed_Community_Test\n--- Details\nin `UdonPort.EditArray(Type elementType)` `TryGetValueObject(out object value);` return as `value==null`\nThen `UdonArrayInspector` is called with null value and `_fields` remains as null.\nWhen \"Save\" button pressed, `UdonArrayInspector<>.GetValues()` is called. And `_fields.Count` cause NullReferenceException.",
